<title>USA: PerfectData rejects Polak bid.</title>
<headline>PerfectData rejects Polak bid.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp said Tuesday its board had rejected an unsolicited bid by Polak Investment Group for 42 percent of PerfectData at $5.50 per share.</p>
<p>It said the bid was rejected as inaqdequate.</p>
<p>&quot;The board of directors would entertain higher bids from other interested parties,&quot; Chief Executive Officer Joseph Mazin said in a statement.</p>
<p>PerfectData said several other parties have indicated an interest in either a major investment in, or an acquisition of PerfectData, but no formal offers have been made.</p>
</text>
